<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 10 bln levs of 47-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 10 bln levs of 47-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed a special issue of 47-day discount T-bills worth 10 billion levs, yielding 31.06 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial intitution or institutions the issue was placed on Friday.</p>
<p>Details of issue follow. Price is in percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3022697000</p>
<p> Type			    discount</p>
<p> Term			    47 days</p>
<p> Issue date		    March 14</p>
<p> Maturity date		 April 30</p>
<p> Par value		     10 bln levs</p>
<p> Selling price		 76.30 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     31.06 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
